{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261117/photo/bkn-20261117003649276-1117_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261117012830\"/><p>私家車掃毀6米鐵欄後向左翻側。(李國健攝)</p><p>西環發生交通意外。今日（17日）凌晨零時18分，多一輛私家車駛至士美菲路12K號對開時失控撞向右邊鐵欄後翻側，司機及2名乘客一度被困車內無法自行離開。</p><p>救援人員接報到場，車內3人自行爬出，證實無人受傷。現場約6米鐵欄被撞毀。警員正調查意外原因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T17:46:13.865197+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T16:36:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T17:39:37.949268+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T17:39:37.949268+00:00","content_hash":"bd46f0bb05dc52b88bb62d518c7a7c4708b9ed7bd5cea2014ec124d334aecfdc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}